export anchor PublicServicePlainStyle:
    number: 46
    screen: Settings
    name: Public service plain
    idea: A plain public-service form in black on white, one bold sans and a thick yellow focus, where nothing is decoration and every heading sits hard left.
    base: light
    palette:
        ink: #0b0c0c, text, checkbox borders, the primary button and the header rule
        paper: #ffffff, the page and fields
        hint: #4f575b, hint text and captions
        rule: #b1b4b6, thin dividers and the bar beside nested options
        link: #1a4f8b, underlined links
        focus: #ffdd00, the focus fill and ring, always paired with black
        panel: #f3f2f1, the secondary button
        success: #1a6b3c, the saved banner border, its title bar and tick
        warning: #b3261e, the Leave workspace button
    type:
        One sans only, Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Liberation Sans,
        sans-serif. The page title is 48px bold at 1.04 line height with a
        19px grey caption above it. Section titles are 32px bold, legends
        24px bold, body 19px regular at 1.45 and hints 19px in grey. Buttons
        are 19px bold.
    layout:
        A white header with the brand on the left and Mara Okafor on the
        right, closed by a 10px black rule. The content is 1020px wide. A
        one third column holds the section links as a plain list, the
        current one bold black with a 5px black bar on its left. The two
        thirds column holds the saved banner, the form as one long column,
        the buttons, a thin rule and the Danger zone. Under 760px the
        columns stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit used as 16, 24 and 40. 16px between options, 32px between groups, 40px between columns.
    density: Low to medium. A single long form read top to bottom.
    corners: Square everywhere. Only radios are round.
    borders: 2px black on fields and boxes, 10px black under the header, 1px #b1b4b6 dividers, a 5px green frame on the saved banner.
    shadows: Only a flat 3px bottom edge on buttons, grey on the black and light buttons and dark red on the warning button.
    icons:
        Almost none. A thick black square tick inside 40px square boxes, a
        filled dot inside 40px round radios, a green tick before Changes
        saved, and a white exclamation mark in a black circle before the
        danger warning.
    focus:
        Links and buttons turn #ffdd00 with black text and a 4px black bar
        beneath. Fields get a 3px #ffdd00 outline plus a 2px black inner
        ring. Boxes get a 4px yellow ring.
    tone: Direct and instructional, such as Select all that apply and If you leave, you lose access to this workspace.
